        "controller_support": "full",
        "detailed_description": "<strong>Treasure Tiger</strong> — A Deadly Game of Luck<br>While your wife is away on a trip, you stumble across a mysterious betting app that promises instant riches — all from the comfort of your home. Desperate for a way out of financial ruin, you start spinning. But this game isn’t just about money. It’s about survival.<br><br><strong>Treasure Tiger</strong> is a first-person horror game where every spin brings you closer to fortune… or to something far worse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spin to Survive</h2>Your only tool is your phone — and the cursed roulette app installed on it. Use the mouse to spin and earn cash through randomized outcomes:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Double or nothing<br><br></li><li>Partial refunds<br><br></li><li>Complete losses<br><br></li><li>Sudden anomalies in your environment</li></ul>Each result affects your surroundings. Power outages. Sudden darkness. Unnatural sounds. And the Tiger… getting closer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep Treasure Tiger Out</h2>As the nights go on, the odds become increasingly stacked against you. A sinister creature known only as Treasure Tiger begins to appear — tapping at windows, lurking in shadows, and waiting for a chance to strike.<br><br>You'll need to:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Monitor your environment carefully<br><br></li><li>Close windows quickly using the <strong>E key</strong><br><br></li><li>Conserve flashlight power<br><br></li><li>React fast when danger hits<br><br></li><li>Fail, and he’ll enter your home. Game over.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Five Nights. One Shot at Salvation.</h2>The game unfolds across five increasingly intense nights. Each night escalates the tension with new challenges, harder odds, and deeper revelations. Clues begin to appear — messages on walls, distorted phone calls, and strange figures in the dark.<br><br>What starts as a gambling app slowly reveals a much darker truth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique blend of gambling mechanics and survival horror<br><br></li><li>First-person gameplay<br><br></li><li>Dynamic environment changes based on spin results<br><br></li><li>Reactive AI: Treasure Tiger adapts to your behavior<br><br></li><li>Atmospheric storytelling with escalating psychological horror<br><br></li><li>Multiple endings depending on your performance<br><br></li><li>Short-session design — easy to pick up, hard to master</li></ul><br>Will you get rich — or get devoured?<br><br><strong>Treasure Tiger</strong> is watching.",
        "about_the_game": "<strong>Treasure Tiger</strong> — A Deadly Game of Luck<br>While your wife is away on a trip, you stumble across a mysterious betting app that promises instant riches — all from the comfort of your home. Desperate for a way out of financial ruin, you start spinning. But this game isn’t just about money. It’s about survival.<br><br><strong>Treasure Tiger</strong> is a first-person horror game where every spin brings you closer to fortune… or to something far worse.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Spin to Survive</h2>Your only tool is your phone — and the cursed roulette app installed on it. Use the mouse to spin and earn cash through randomized outcomes:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Double or nothing<br><br></li><li>Partial refunds<br><br></li><li>Complete losses<br><br></li><li>Sudden anomalies in your environment</li></ul>Each result affects your surroundings. Power outages. Sudden darkness. Unnatural sounds. And the Tiger… getting closer.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Keep Treasure Tiger Out</h2>As the nights go on, the odds become increasingly stacked against you. A sinister creature known only as Treasure Tiger begins to appear — tapping at windows, lurking in shadows, and waiting for a chance to strike.<br><br>You'll need to:<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Monitor your environment carefully<br><br></li><li>Close windows quickly using the <strong>E key</strong><br><br></li><li>Conserve flashlight power<br><br></li><li>React fast when danger hits<br><br></li><li>Fail, and he’ll enter your home. Game over.</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Five Nights. One Shot at Salvation.</h2>The game unfolds across five increasingly intense nights. Each night escalates the tension with new challenges, harder odds, and deeper revelations. Clues begin to appear — messages on walls, distorted phone calls, and strange figures in the dark.<br><br>What starts as a gambling app slowly reveals a much darker truth.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>A unique blend of gambling mechanics and survival horror<br><br></li><li>First-person gameplay<br><br></li><li>Dynamic environment changes based on spin results<br><br></li><li>Reactive AI: Treasure Tiger adapts to your behavior<br><br></li><li>Atmospheric storytelling with escalating psychological horror<br><br></li><li>Multiple endings depending on your performance<br><br></li><li>Short-session design — easy to pick up, hard to master</li></ul><br>Will you get rich — or get devoured?<br><br><strong>Treasure Tiger</strong> is watching.",
        "short_description": "You’ve got five nights to strike it rich and save your future. All you have to do is spin, survive, and keep the windows shut. Treasure Tiger is out there — grinning, watching, waiting. He says it’s all about luck… but he’s not here to play fair.",
